.SS "void sc_options_set_spacing (\fBsc_options_t\fP * opt, int space_type, int space_help)"

.PP
Set the spacing for \fBsc_options_print_summary\fP\&. There are two values to be set: the spacing from the beginning of the printed line to the type of the option variable, and from the beginning of the printed line to the help string\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIopt\fP Valid options structure\&. 
.br
\fIspace_type\fP Number of spaces to the type display, for example <INT>, <STRING>, etc\&. Setting this negative sets the default 20\&. 
.br
\fIspace_help\fP Number of space to the help string\&. Setting this negative sets the default 32\&. 
.RE
.PP

